B.aoj=s(["Idle speech bubbles now size themselves to the message while keeping the text and tail beside the helper.","Idle prompts now follow animation changes, appear zero to two times per sequence, and pause after two consecutive prompts.","Grooming, scratching, and playful animations now have matching phrases alongside more helpful and playful messages."],t.s)
